{
 "id": 1306900,
 "titulo": "v460 Update Details (Updated)",
 "fecha": 1543309365727,
 "modificada": 1733042392169,
 "url": "https://forum.netmarble.com/futurefight_en/view/2196/1306900",
 "html": "<p style=\"margin: 0in; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana, sans-serif; color: #333333; font-size: 12pt;\"><img style=\"max-width: 100%; height: auto;\" src=\"http://sgimage.netmarble.com/images/puble/community/GAME/futurefight_en/2196/2018/11/27/1543305605317.jpg\" /></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana, sans-serif; color: #333333; font-size: 12pt;\">Greetings, Agents!</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana, sans-serif; color: #333333; font-size: 12pt;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana, sans-serif; color: #333333; font-size: 12pt;\">This is CM Fragment of Marvel Future Fight!</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana, sans-serif; color: #333333; font-size: 12pt;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana, sans-serif; color: #333333; font-size: 12pt;\">We have made new, significant additions and changes to the game for the upcoming update, from unveiling our all-new original Heroes, <strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\">Crescent &amp; Io, </strong>to the much-needed adjustments made on <strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\">Hyperion!</strong> </span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana, sans-serif; color: #333333; font-size: 12pt;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana, sans-serif; color: #333333; font-size: 12pt;\">To kick things off, we would like to introduce 3 new characters in MARVEL Future Fight: </span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana, sans-serif; color: #333333; font-size: 12pt;\">The mystical<strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"> White Fox;</strong> the dangerous wizard <strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\">Morgan Le Fay</strong>, and our third MFF-exclusive in-game duo character, <strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\">Crescent &amp; Io</strong>!</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana, sans-serif; color: #333333; font-size: 12pt;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana, sans-serif; color: #333333; font-size: 12pt;\">In line with the new characters, we will also be introducing 4 new uniforms: <strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\">Captain America (Sharon Rogers)</strong>, <strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\">Luna Snow</strong>, <strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\">Spiderman (Miles Morales)</strong>, and <strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\">Hyperion</strong>!</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana, sans-serif; color: #333333; font-size: 12pt;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana, sans-serif; color: #333333; font-size: 12pt;\">Unlocking Potential can now be achieved for 7 new characters as well!</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana, sans-serif; color: #333333; font-size: 12pt;\">And, as requested by many of our Agents, <strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\">Sharon Rogers&rsquo; Tier-3 upgrade</strong> is now available!</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana, sans-serif; color: #333333; font-size: 12pt;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana, sans-serif; color: #333333; font-size: 12pt;\">Also, Heroic Quest has been beefed up with the addition of White Fox!</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana, sans-serif; color: #333333; font-size: 12pt;\">Improvements are also made to Giant Boss Raid, which allows you to see the Tier of your teammates!</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana, sans-serif; color: #333333; font-size: 12pt;\">Added new Quest Packs in Special Missions, together with the promised rework on <strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\">Hyperion</strong>!</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana, sans-serif; color: #333333; font-size: 12pt;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana, sans-serif; color: #333333; font-size: 12pt;\">What are you waiting for? Check the details below!</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<hr />\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 'Cambria Math','serif'; mso-fareast-font-family: 나눔고딕; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Cambria Math'; color: #ff6c00;\">▣</span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: 'Verdana','sans-serif'; mso-fareast-font-family: 나눔고딕; mso-bidi-font-family: Gulim; color: #ff6c00;\"> Added 3 New Characters</span></strong></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana, sans-serif; color: #333333; font-size: 12pt;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana, sans-serif; color: #333333; font-size: 12pt;\">A brand new and original Korean character and a formidable wizard comes to Marvel Future Fight!</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana, sans-serif; color: #333333; font-size: 12pt;\">Crescent, White Fox, and Morgan Le Fay has been added in the game.</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><img src=\"http://c2.img.netmarble.kr/mobile/6N/2018/11/271634/cres.jpg\" /></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><img src=\"http://c2.img.netmarble.kr/mobile/6N/2018/11/271536/whit.png\" /></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><img src=\"http://c2.img.netmarble.kr/mobile/6N/2018/11/271658/morg.png\" /></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 'Verdana','sans-serif'; mso-fareast-font-family: 나눔고딕; color: red;\">* The Skill de&#115;criptions shown above are at Skill Level 1.</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 'Verdana','sans-serif'; mso-fareast-font-family: 나눔고딕; color: red;\">* Crescent can be acquired through the &ldquo;Get 20 Biometrics Daily&rdquo; in the Mission Shop.</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 'Verdana','sans-serif'; mso-fareast-font-family: 나눔고딕; color: red;\">* White Fox can be acquired through Heroic Quest.</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 'Verdana','sans-serif'; mso-fareast-font-family: 나눔고딕; color: red;\">* Morgan Le Fay can be acquired through the Premium Hero Chest in the Store, &#83;elector: Biometrics and Processor: Biometrics [Universal].</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 'Cambria Math','serif'; mso-fareast-font-family: 나눔고딕; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Cambria Math'; color: #ff6c00;\">▣</span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: 'Verdana','sans-serif'; mso-fareast-font-family: 나눔고딕; mso-bidi-font-family: Gulim; color: #ff6c00;\"> Added 4 New Uniforms</span></strong></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana, sans-serif; color: #333333; font-size: 12pt;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana, sans-serif; color: #333333; font-size: 12pt;\">Existing characters have been given a significant upgrade through the power of uniforms.</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana, sans-serif; color: #333333; font-size: 12pt;\">Captain America (Sharon Rogers), Luna Snow, Spiderman (Miles Morales), and Hyperion all receive new uniforms on this update.&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><img src=\"http://c2.img.netmarble.kr/mobile/6N/2018/11/271334/uni1.png\" /></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 'Verdana','sans-serif'; mso-fareast-font-family: 나눔고딕; color: red;\">* The Skill de&#115;criptions shown above are at Skill Level 1.</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 'Verdana','sans-serif'; mso-fareast-font-family: 나눔고딕; color: red;\">* 4 new Uniforms will be on sale during the event period. You can check them out on the Marvel Universe menu and by going to the Uniform Room.</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 'Cambria Math','serif'; mso-fareast-font-family: 나눔고딕; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Cambria Math'; color: #ff6c00; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-ansi-language: EN-US; mso-fareast-language: KO; mso-bidi-language: AR-SA;\">▣</span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 'Verdana','sans-serif'; mso-fareast-font-family: 나눔고딕; mso-bidi-font-family: Gulim; color: #ff6c00; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-ansi-language: EN-US; mso-fareast-language: KO; mso-bidi-language: AR-SA;\"> Added Potential for 7 More Characters</span></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana, sans-serif; color: #666666; font-size: 12pt;\">With the November update, the following characters will have their Potential unlocked: <br /> Crescent, Luna Snow, Captain America (Sharon Rogers), Morgan le Fay, White Fox, Spiderman (Miles Morales), and Hyperion </span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-family: 'Verdana','sans-serif'; mso-fareast-font-family: 나눔고딕; color: #666666;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Unlock their potential and raise their level to 70!</span></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><img src=\"http://c2.img.netmarble.kr/mobile/6N/2018/11/271334/po10.png\" /></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong><span style=\"color: #ff6c00;\">▣</span></strong><strong><span style=\"color: #ff6c00;\"> Added Character for Tier-3 Advancement</span></strong></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; color: #333333; font-size: 12pt;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; color: #333333; font-size: 12pt;\">A proud MARVEL Future Fight-exclusive character, Captain America (Sharon Rogers) receives her Tier-3 Upgrade!</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 'Verdana','sans-serif'; mso-fareast-font-family: 나눔고딕; color: #333333;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 12pt;\">Throw in her new uniform, and she becomes an unstoppable force that everyone will use to great lengths!</span></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><img src=\"https://media.giphy.com/media/TgFmLpkfsreHi5efIZ/giphy.gif\" /></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><img src=\"http://c2.img.netmarble.kr/mobile/6N/2018/11/271334/sh%60.png\" /></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong><span style=\"color: #ff6c00;\">▣</span></strong><strong><span style=\"color: #ff6c00;\"> Hyperion Rework</span></strong></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; color: #666666; font-size: 12pt;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 12pt;\">In this update, we will reveal Hyperion&rsquo;s improvement!</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 'Verdana','sans-serif'; mso-fareast-font-family: 나눔고딕;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 12pt;\">Without further ado, here is the detailed rework to the abilities of Hyperion.</span></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 'Verdana','sans-serif'; mso-fareast-font-family: 나눔고딕;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 12pt;\"><img src=\"http://c2.img.netmarble.kr/mobile/6N/2018/11/271516/hyp1.jpg\" /></span></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><img src=\"http://c2.img.netmarble.kr/mobile/6N/2018/11/271722/hyp1233444.png\" /></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 'Verdana','sans-serif'; mso-fareast-font-family: 나눔고딕; color: red;\">* The Skill de&#115;criptions shown above are at Skill Level 1.</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong><span style=\"color: #ff6c00;\">▣</span></strong><strong><span style=\"color: #ff6c00;\"> Giant Boss Raid Improvements</span></strong></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong><span style=\"color: #ff6c00;\">&nbsp;</span></strong></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong><span style=\"font-weight: normal;\">A variety of new features have been added to Giant Boss Raid.</span></strong></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong><span style=\"font-weight: normal;\">Work with other Agents to make your boss raid more convenient!</span></strong></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong><span style=\"color: #ff6c00;\">&nbsp;</span></strong></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: Verdana, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana;\">1. You can now see the Level and the Tier of the characters your teammates have inside the lobby.&nbsp;</span></span></strong></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><img src=\"http://c2.img.netmarble.kr/mobile/6N/2018/11/271334/gbr1.png\" /></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 'Verdana','sans-serif'; mso-fareast-font-family: 나눔고딕; color: #5b9bd5; mso-themecolor: accent1;\">- If you know your teammates and the enemy, your odds of winning will be higher! Work with other Agents to defeat the boss!</span></strong></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: Verdana, sans-serif;\">2. </span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: 'Verdana','sans-serif'; mso-fareast-font-family: 나눔고딕;\">After entering the lobby, you can see an idle message when one of your teammates is changing characters before starting the raid.</span></strong></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><img src=\"http://c2.img.netmarble.kr/mobile/6N/2018/11/271334/gbr2.png\" /></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong><span style=\"color: black;\">3. </span></strong></span><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"font-family: 'Verdana','sans-serif'; mso-fareast-font-family: 나눔고딕;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 12pt;\">Added the ability to sort your characters into your most recently used ones.</span> </span></strong></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana, sans-serif; color: #333333; font-size: 12pt;\"><img style=\"max-width: 100%; height: auto;\" src=\"http://sgimage.netmarble.com/images/puble/community/GAME/futurefight_en/2196/2018/11/27/1543298607353.jpg\" /><br /></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: Verdana, sans-serif;\">4. The characters you recently &#115;elected are saved and will be automatically &#115;elected when you enter the lobby once again.</span></strong></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\">&nbsp;<img style=\"font-size: 11px;\" src=\"http://c2.img.netmarble.kr/mobile/6N/2018/11/271502/gbr4.png\" /></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: Verdana, sans-serif;\">5. After clearing the Giant Boss Raid, you can make the request to participate in the raid once more with the same Agents.</span></strong></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><img src=\"http://c2.img.netmarble.kr/mobile/6N/2018/11/271502/gbr5.png\" /></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong><span style=\"color: #5b9bd5; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; font-weight: normal;\">-</span> </strong></span><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"font-family: 'Verdana','sans-serif'; mso-fareast-font-family: 나눔고딕; color: #5b9bd5; mso-themecolor: accent1;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 12pt;\">When the counter starts, you can easily re-enter the raid with the same agents by &#115;electing [Retry]</span></span></strong></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana;\"><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"color: #333333; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">6. Giant Boss Raid clear rewards have been slightly improved</span></strong></span><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"font-family: 'Verdana','sans-serif'; mso-fareast-font-family: 나눔고딕; color: #333333;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana;\"> with more chances to earn Type Enhancement Materials.</span></span></strong></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 'Cambria Math','serif'; mso-fareast-font-family: 나눔고딕; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Cambria Math'; color: #ff6c00;\">▣</span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: 'Verdana','sans-serif'; mso-fareast-font-family: 나눔고딕; mso-bidi-font-family: Gulim; color: #ff6c00;\"> New Heroic Quest Pack and Improvements to Heroic Quest mode</span></strong></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana, sans-serif; color: #333333; font-size: 12pt;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana, sans-serif; color: #333333; font-size: 12pt;\">Heroic Quest has added a new Quest Pack for our November update with White Fox.</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana, sans-serif; color: #333333; font-size: 12pt;\"> <span style=\"font-family: Verdana, sans-serif;\">Enjoy our new Heroic Quest mode with a new story and additional features!</span></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"font-family: 'Verdana','sans-serif'; mso-fareast-font-family: 나눔고딕; color: #333333;\">1. A new Heroic Quest Pack has been added: White Fox: Fox Hunt</span></strong></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"font-family: 'Verdana','sans-serif'; mso-fareast-font-family: 나눔고딕; color: #333333;\">&nbsp;</span></strong></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; color: #333333; font-size: 12pt;\">You can unlock White Fox by playing her Heroic Quest pack! As the last of the Kumiho, she brings the mystical powers of the nine-tailed fox to the battlefield. </span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; color: #333333;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana, sans-serif; color: #333333; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana;\">Learn more regarding her abilities and story by progressing further into her Heroic Quest pack.</span></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><img src=\"http://c2.img.netmarble.kr/mobile/6N/2018/11/271502/hq1.png\" /></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"font-family: 'Verdana','sans-serif'; mso-fareast-font-family: 나눔고딕; color: #5b9bd5; mso-themecolor: accent1;\">- The White Fox Heroic Quest Pack will cost Crystals. However, you get additional rewards for each stage!</span></strong></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>2. A [Stop Quest Pack] function has been added.</strong></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 'Verdana','sans-serif'; mso-fareast-font-family: 나눔고딕; color: #333333;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 12pt;\">This feature is helpful if you accidentally picked the wrong Quest Pack, or you would want to challenge another Quest Pack and you want to keep the progress of your current Quest Pack.</span></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><img src=\"http://c2.img.netmarble.kr/mobile/6N/2018/11/271502/hq2.png\" /></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 'Verdana','sans-serif'; mso-fareast-font-family: 나눔고딕; color: black; mso-themecolor: text1;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Verdana;\">If you stop the currently active Heroic Quest Pack, the remaining time and the progress of the pack will stop.</span></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; color: red; font-size: 12pt;\">* However, if you are in the last region, you cannot use the Stop Quest Pack function.</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><img src=\"http://c2.img.netmarble.kr/mobile/6N/2018/11/271502/hq3.png\" /></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 'Verdana','sans-serif'; mso-fareast-font-family: 나눔고딕; color: #5b9bd5; mso-themecolor: accent1;\">- You can also cancel your [Stop Quest Pack] request any time before you finish the region or you reach the end time of the region.</span></strong></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong style=\"color: #333333;\"><span style=\"color: #ff6c00;\">▣</span></strong><strong><span style=\"color: #ff6c00;\"> A new Special Mission Quest Pack has been added</span><span style=\"color: #ff6c00;\"><span style=\"color: #333333;\">!</span></span></strong></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 12pt;\">A new Quest Pack is now added to our Special Missions!</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 12pt;\">Clear the challenges for specific missions and earn various rewards.</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 12pt;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span class=\"MsoHyper&#108;ink\" style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 12pt;\">Please refer to the following guide for details on Special Missions.</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 12pt;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-indent: -12.0pt; mso-char-indent-count: -1.0; margin: 0in 0in .0001pt 12.0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 12pt;\">The &lsquo;All Things New&rsquo; Quest Pack consists of a total of 32 challenges.</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-indent: -12.0pt; mso-char-indent-count: -1.0; margin: 0in 0in .0001pt 12.0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 12pt;\">Rewards range between Premium Hero Chest, Extreme Obelisks and other items.</span></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-indent: -12.0pt; mso-char-indent-count: -1.0; margin: 0in 0in .0001pt 12.0pt;\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-indent: -12.0pt; mso-char-indent-count: -1.0; margin: 0in 0in .0001pt 12.0pt;\"><img src=\"http://c2.img.netmarble.kr/mobile/6N/2018/11/271502/spmis1.png\" /></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-indent: -12.0pt; mso-char-indent-count: -1.0; margin: 0in 0in .0001pt 12.0pt;\"><img src=\"http://c2.img.netmarble.kr/mobile/6N/2018/11/271502/spmis2.png\" /></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-indent: -12.0pt; mso-char-indent-count: -1.0; margin: 0in 0in .0001pt 12.0pt;\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 'Verdana','sans-serif'; mso-fareast-font-family: 나눔고딕; color: #5b9bd5; mso-themecolor: accent1;\">- Train Hulkling, Wiccan, Squirrel Girl, Songbird, Gwenpool and White Tiger to prepare them to become the next New Avengers!</span></strong></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 12pt;\">The reward for clearing all achievements is a C.T.P of Destruction.</span></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><img src=\"http://c2.img.netmarble.kr/mobile/6N/2018/11/271536/spmis3.png\" /></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong><span style=\"color: #ff6c00;\">▣</span></strong><strong><span style=\"color: #ff6c00;\"> Added a new package in the Mission Shop!</span></strong></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 12pt;\">A new sub&#115;cription package has been added!</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>S.H.I.E.L.D Special Support</strong> gives you Clear Tickets for 15 days, every time you log in. </span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; color: #333333; font-size: 12pt;\"> <span style=\"color: black;\">Other than clear tickets, it also gives you Special Benefits and additional rewards. You can read below for more information.&nbsp;</span></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><img src=\"http://c2.img.netmarble.kr/mobile/6N/2018/11/271502/subpack1.png\" /></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><img src=\"http://c2.img.netmarble.kr/mobile/6N/2018/11/271502/subpackchart.png\" /></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Verdana;\"><strong><span style=\"color: #ff6c00;\">▣</span></strong><strong><span style=\"color: #ff6c00;\"> Other Game Improvements</span></strong></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"color: black;\">&nbsp;</span></strong></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"color: black;\">1. </span></strong><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"color: black;\">The highlight for high-tier rewards received in Co-Op play that goes directly to your Inbox has been improved.</span></strong></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"color: black;\">&nbsp;</span></strong></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"color: black;\">2. A [Pack] tab has been added in the [Inbox].</span></strong></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><img src=\"http://c2.img.netmarble.kr/mobile/6N/2018/11/271509/pck1.png\" /></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"font-family: 'Verdana','sans-serif'; mso-fareast-font-family: 나눔고딕; color: #5b9bd5; mso-themecolor: accent1;\">- The [Pack] Tab can be used to check the list of purchased item packages.</span></strong></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Verdana;\"><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"color: black;\">3. Added a New Theme to the Uniform Collection</span></strong></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"color: #333333;\">- Captain America: Civil War </span></strong></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span style=\"color: #333333; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: yes;\">&nbsp;</span>Civil War: Captain America&rsquo;s Side / Civil War: Iron Man&rsquo;s Side</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"color: #333333;\">- Doctor Strange</span></strong></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"color: #333333;\">- Guardians of the Galaxy</span></strong></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><img src=\"http://c2.img.netmarble.kr/mobile/6N/2018/11/271509/unicol.png\" /></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; color: #333333;\"><span style=\"color: black;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; color: #333333;\"><span style=\"color: black;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; color: #333333;\"><span style=\"color: black;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"color: #333333;\">4.&nbsp;</span></strong></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><strong style=\"font-size: 10pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Verdana, sans-serif;\">A Character Ranking shortcut &#98;utton has been added to the character information window.</span></strong></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><img src=\"http://c2.img.netmarble.kr/mobile/6N/2018/11/271509/charan.png\" /></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong><span style=\"color: #333333;\">5. Improvements on Custom Gear Management</span></strong></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong><span style=\"color: #333333;\">&nbsp;- Quick Upgrade: </span></strong><strong><span style=\"color: #333333; font-weight: normal;\">When using Quick Upgrade, materials will be &#115;elected starting with the lowest rank up until the rank equals to that of the &#115;elected gear.</span></strong></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong><span style=\"color: #333333;\">&nbsp;- Auto &#83;elect: </span></strong><strong><span style=\"color: #333333; font-weight: normal;\">You can &#115;elect your preferred material rank of Custom Gear you want to use as enhancement material.&nbsp;</span></strong></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><img src=\"http://c2.img.netmarble.kr/mobile/6N/2018/11/271509/cgear1.png\" /></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; margin-bottom: .0001pt; tab-stops: 125.25pt;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 'Verdana','sans-serif'; mso-fareast-font-family: 나눔고딕; color: #5b9bd5; mso-themecolor: accent1;\">- You can now use Quick Upgrade to enhance Custom Gear!</span></strong></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; margin-bottom: .0001pt; tab-stops: 125.25pt;\"><img src=\"http://c2.img.netmarble.kr/mobile/6N/2018/11/271509/cgear2.png\" /></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; margin-bottom: .0001pt; tab-stops: 125.25pt;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 'Verdana','sans-serif'; mso-fareast-font-family: 나눔고딕; color: #5b9bd5; mso-themecolor: accent1;\">- With the Auto &#83;elect feature added, you can now mix Custom Gears with different ranks to enhance your Custom Gear!</span></strong></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; margin-bottom: .0001pt; tab-stops: 125.25pt;\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 'Verdana','sans-serif'; mso-fareast-font-family: 나눔고딕; mso-bidi-font-family: Gulim; mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">6. You can now see the rewards you receive when a shifter appears during battle within the Mission Preparation screen.&nbsp;</span></span></strong></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><img src=\"http://c2.img.netmarble.kr/mobile/6N/2018/11/271509/shift.png\" /></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 'Verdana','sans-serif'; mso-fareast-font-family: 나눔고딕; mso-bidi-font-family: Gulim; mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">7. Improvements to Shadowland: You can now see more information regarding the floor by &#115;electing [Stage Info].</span></span></strong></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><img src=\"http://c2.img.netmarble.kr/mobile/6N/2018/11/271509/shadow.png\" /></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong><span style=\"color: #333333;\">8.</span></strong></span><strong><span style=\"font-family: 'Verdana','sans-serif'; mso-fareast-font-family: 나눔고딕; mso-bidi-font-family: Gulim; mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 12pt;\">&nbsp;</span></span></strong><span style=\"font-family: Verdana;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><strong>For Game Modes that use 2 teams like Alliance Conquest and Shadowland: On the Preparaion screen before starting a stage, you can now choose a team bonus for each character team.</strong></span></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><img src=\"http://c2.img.netmarble.kr/mobile/6N/2018/11/271509/shad.png\" /></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 'Verdana','sans-serif'; mso-fareast-font-family: 나눔고딕; mso-bidi-font-family: Gulim; color: #333333; mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\">9.&nbsp;</span></strong></span><strong><span style=\"font-family: 'Verdana','sans-serif'; mso-fareast-font-family: 나눔고딕; mso-bidi-font-family: Gulim; mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 12pt;\">Improvements to Shadowland:&nbsp;</span></span></strong><strong style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 'Verdana','sans-serif'; mso-fareast-font-family: 'MS Mincho'; mso-bidi-font-family: Gulim; color: #333333; mso-fareast-language: JA; mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\">On the [Set Team] screen of Shadowland, you can now see the previous characters you used to clear the floor, with a &lsquo;CLEAR&rsquo; text above their portraits.&nbsp;</span></strong></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><img src=\"http://c2.img.netmarble.kr/mobile/6N/2018/11/271509/shad3.png\" /></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 'Verdana','sans-serif'; mso-fareast-font-family: 나눔고딕; mso-bidi-font-family: Gulim; color: #333333; mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 12pt;\">10. If your Assembly Points are full, you can now purchase up to 3 Energy recharge items at once.</span></span></strong></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><img src=\"http://c2.img.netmarble.kr/mobile/6N/2018/11/271516/assem.png\" /></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 'Verdana','sans-serif'; mso-fareast-font-family: 나눔고딕; mso-bidi-font-family: Gulim; color: #333333; mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 12pt;\">11.&nbsp;</span></span></strong><span style=\"color: #333333; font-family: Verdana;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><strong>The cost for deploying a unit on SHIELD Lab - Warp Device has been decreased slightly.</strong></span></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 'Cambria Math','serif'; mso-fareast-font-family: 나눔고딕; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Cambria Math'; color: #ff6c00;\">▣</span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: 'Verdana','sans-serif'; mso-fareast-font-family: 나눔고딕; mso-bidi-font-family: Gulim; color: #ff6c00;\"> Other fixes</span></strong></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 'Verdana','sans-serif'; mso-fareast-font-family: 나눔고딕; color: #333333;\">1</span></strong><span style=\"font-family: 'Verdana','sans-serif'; mso-fareast-font-family: 나눔고딕; color: #333333; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;\">.&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 'Verdana','sans-serif'; mso-fareast-font-family: 나눔고딕; color: #333333;\">Fixed a visual glitch where some characters became transparent (or translucent) each time they use a skill. </span></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 'Verdana','sans-serif'; mso-fareast-font-family: 나눔고딕; color: #333333;\">2.</span></strong> <span style=\"font-family: 'Verdana','sans-serif'; mso-fareast-font-family: 나눔고딕;\">Fixed an issue with Battleworld mode where the [Auto Play] checkbox is showing up as \"Locked\".</span></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 'Verdana','sans-serif'; mso-fareast-font-family: 나눔고딕;\">3.</span></strong><span style=\"font-family: 'Verdana','sans-serif'; mso-fareast-font-family: 나눔고딕;\"> Fixed an issue with Skills on game mode. When previewing a Skill using the in-game [Skill Preview] function and pressing the \"Back\" &#98;utton of your Android device, the Skill Icons disappear and only the [Basic Attack] &#98;utton is visible after you open any stage.</span></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 'Verdana','sans-serif'; mso-fareast-font-family: 나눔고딕;\">4.</span></strong><span style=\"font-family: 'Verdana','sans-serif'; mso-fareast-font-family: 나눔고딕;\"> Fixed the issue regarding Skills that has continuous effects (Ex: Blue Marvel's Magnificent Beam, Cyclops's Optic Barrage) stopping earlier than intended when activated within Shadowland.</span></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 'Verdana','sans-serif'; mso-fareast-font-family: 나눔고딕;\">5.</span></strong><span style=\"font-family: 'Verdana','sans-serif'; mso-fareast-font-family: 나눔고딕;\"> <span style=\"color: #333333;\">Fixed a visual glitch in the Uniform List menu, where the passive skills of the characters are displaying a number, which is not intended.</span></span></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 'Verdana','sans-serif'; mso-fareast-font-family: 나눔고딕;\">6.</span></strong><span style=\"font-family: 'Verdana','sans-serif'; mso-fareast-font-family: 나눔고딕;\"> Fixed an issue regarding Giant Boss Raid where Master Mold is recovering HP abnormally.</span></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 'Verdana','sans-serif'; mso-fareast-font-family: 나눔고딕;\">7.</span></strong><span style=\"font-family: 'Verdana','sans-serif'; mso-fareast-font-family: 나눔고딕;\"> Fixed the issue regarding Giant Boss Raid where on some instances, you are not able to switch to any of your undefeated characters when Master Mold defeats one of your characters.</span></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>8</strong>. Fixed an issue in Giant Boss Raid where changing characters does not work in certain situations.&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 'Verdana','sans-serif'; mso-fareast-font-family: 나눔고딕;\">9.</span></strong><span style=\"font-family: 'Verdana','sans-serif'; mso-fareast-font-family: 나눔고딕;\"> Fixed an issue in the SHIELD Lab Warp Device, where if you tap the &ldquo;Complete Now&rdquo; &#98;utton, it shows an error code popup and it does not proceed.</span></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana, sans-serif; color: #333333; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>10.</strong> <span style=\"color: #000000;\">Fixed an issue in Giant Boss Raid Lobby where the [Kick] &#98;utton does not work as intended on some situations.</span></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana, sans-serif; color: #333333; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>11.&nbsp;</strong>Fixed an issue in Giant Boss Raid where the Team Bonus effect of other Agents affects the other teams participating in the raid.</span></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span style=\"color: #ff0000; font-family: Verdana; font-size: 12pt; white-space: pre-wrap;\">* This fix was added in our November update but was not included in our update details. - Added 11/30 3:20 AM (UTC +0) | 7:20 PM (PST)</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-family: 'Verdana','sans-serif'; mso-fareast-font-family: 나눔고딕; color: #333333;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Thank you for supporting Marvel Future Fight!</span></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\">&nbsp;<img style=\"max-width: 100%; height: auto;\" src=\"http://sgimage.netmarble.com/images/puble/community/GAME/futurefight_en/2196/2018/11/27/1543305634499.jpg\" /></p>"
}